{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9292c6c144a2982fcdf3a8ac4876b3c425b179d7a921d6a23506452feefa353a","ja":"憧れの大人デート","zh":"憧憬中的成人约会","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1cb1693b8843c4b99c14e309b51909e284bf27533f287ac653f97fc36132e40b","ja":"そしていよいよ取材当日……","zh":"然后终于到了采访当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fd5a7ccffd9e7dbe910c8f548f316537c6a77dffab3a33e7b52601a276da7607","ja":"志保ちゃん……これ、読んでみて。私が考えた\n大人のデートコースなんだけど……どうかな？","zh":"志保……读读看这个。是我构思的\n成年人约会路线……你觉得怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"38147824564394ff9492239e2b0b8871fc9d54c44fdd9f56bb7e569673f7c4cb","ja":"はい、ありがとうございます。","zh":"好的，非常感谢。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"15c2b19c426589f942e7c14809fc35a4505910db60d0a878183a402fa9f9495b","ja":"そうですね……いいと思います。けど……。","zh":"也是呢……我觉得挺好的。不过……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6d6fc6909d1297f31cb6eb583202c5e84e112542182e0dccd589e55dabc4bdb2","ja":"な、何か問題でもあるかな？","zh":"有、有什么问题吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cd9f6bf93f63b60b3111ed2b50d1ef12586431fb5481606d47d3d4ef41ffa91e","ja":"い、いえ、問題は別に。\nただ、風花さんって、意外と積極的なんだなって……。","zh":"没、没有，倒也没什么问题。\n只是觉得，风花小姐意外地很主动呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"50199cf72d88100c6b6bfbf6669593668f7672e4c822c2e64f5166fff7895527","ja":"その、ふたりっきりでいる時間とスポットが\n多かったので……。","zh":"那个，因为两个人独处的时间和地点\n都比较多……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9c6c3e0efcf975749fa3a2a001e485ed446beafa63ab99cc7e50d6ece196d252","ja":"え、あ、それは……大人ならきっと、仕事であまり\n会えなくて、そういう時間が欲しいかなって……。","zh":"诶、啊，那个是……我想如果是大人的话，肯定会因为工作\n没法经常见面，所以会想要那样的时光吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4041870e67c8aae5fef9a60574819c807a6301af986ea899d69943a3cf7b2e41","ja":"こ、こんなに積極的だと志保ちゃんも恥かしいよね！\nでもスタッフさんにもこのルート伝えちゃったし……。","zh":"这、这么积极的话，志保也会不好意思吧！\n可是，都已经跟工作人员说了要走这条路线了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ba9e5df384ddceac339e3e5eee4572dd0d2731b51cb8548c4caef2e6cf7bbf67","ja":"「北沢さん、豊川さん！\nそろそろスタンバイお願いしまーす！」","zh":"「北泽小姐、丰川小姐！\n差不多该去候场了——！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6f29fd38614e21323a8cbb7cc7ffd85e6691b8920dcefbf4bd857ba592e69a6","ja":"風花さん、大丈夫です。\n撮影が始まりますし行きましょう……いえ。","zh":"风花，没事的。\n拍摄马上就要开始了，我们走吧……不对。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"71a93e709d96361ddc06f7b8549be5155e8a3a9b10ea0f18431347314147671d","ja":"「それじゃあ祥子。きみの決めたデートコース、\nふたりで一緒に楽しもうか」","zh":"“那么祥子，你决定的约会路线，\n我们两个人一起好好享受吧”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"81cc7e4426d31dd0a29a270f582950d474556a7ec9759b76d386cbbbf15b952f","ja":"えっ、ええええっ……！？\nし、志保ちゃん……！？","zh":"诶，诶诶诶……！？\n志、志保……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b9182e993b94ff0b9bef0ba76592b2bb686bf51b9b507679abffb37c6d494331","ja":"そ、そんなに驚かないでください。\nわ、私まで恥ずかしくなりますから……。","zh":"请、请不要那么惊讶。\n连、连我都会觉得不好意思的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0c656c8dee4ef0ce5ccf12eda6dbefedd04c3ed75c81dbb52e0497de8778d96f","ja":"風花さんが素敵なデートコースを考えてくれたから、\n今度は私が彼氏役としてひっぱらないとって……。","zh":"多亏风花小姐想出了这么棒的约会路线，\n所以这次轮到我作为男朋友角色来引领她了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"75ac5400f5d7956cd89e266f3f5d9d22fdd8df3ae8a21ce7f6835a865f6d43e8","ja":"と、とにかく……「さぁ、少し歩こうか。\nほら、早く僕の腕に手を回して」","zh":"总、总之……“来，走两步吧。\n快，挽住我的手臂”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3d5085980df9178ca2397788cff93a433418d874210fcd8b6ddc67b985f0855b","ja":"志保ちゃん……ありがとう……！\n……ううん。違うかな。","zh":"志保……谢谢你……！\n……不对。好像不是这样。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1355.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"cbfbe88366d1aea7712b97ed488d3dccbe1b94f38025fe7f65b015ef9fc36c23","ja":"「うふふ。はい、わかりました。\n今日は私をエスコートしてくださいね。有馬先生」","zh":"「呵呵。好的，我知道了。\n今天就请护送我吧，有马老师」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
